  m_Name: Rampage Cell Config
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CellName: Rampage
  Description: Demolition arena cell - a forest of big cacti, spires, rosettes, pines
    and coral filling the whole volume from just outside the nucleus out to the
    membrane (planting bands 0.17-0.97 of the membrane radius, volume-uniform), seeded
    across all three domains at levels 1-5 so every pilot always has hostile mass to
    smash and the sizes read as a real range. The nucleus itself stays clear - it is
    the crystal's contested ground. Destruction is the active sink; flora regrowth
    below Frenzy keeps the forest stocked.
